      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I think the status of this bug should be changed \"complete\", it seems to be fixed.\n\nAccording to VRChat Wiki (or more specifically @{60dd2a998871d03e7f3806ae|full_name}), this is only shown when 2FA is not enabled. https://wiki.vrchat.com/wiki/Loading_Screens#Banners\n\nThe undocumented infopush API contains submitted data from the client about 2FA status nowadays (in addition to platform such as PC, VR/desktop, PCVR, VRC+ status, etc).\n\nI loaded up `wld_c95b8313-8607-4437-a808-57bd86eef5a1` for an infinite loading screen and I did not run into this 2FA banner for several minutes any longer. (I had 2FA enabled.)",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
